        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 2 The secondary actor providing the contract certificate will validate the OEM provisioning certificate according to [V2G20-1001], [V2G20-2324] and [V2G20-2325] and verify the signature of the body element of the CertificateInstallationReq using the public key (from \"subjectPublicKey\") of OEM provisioning certificate included in OEMProvisioningCertChain parameter of CertificateInstallationReq message.",
