        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 5 SA is expected to generate and encrypt the contract certificate credentials using the same curve as the provided OEM provisioning certificate does. In case SA considers the curve or ECC algorithm used in the provided OEM provisioning certificate insecure, i.e. the SA's configuration parameter from [V2G20-2320] does not match the one of the EVCC, the SA will not be able to provide a contract certificate.",
